<title>USA: JP Realty Inc Q1 EPS $0.36 vs $0.34.</title>
<headline>JP Realty Inc Q1 EPS $0.36 vs $0.34.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.36		    $0.34</p>
<p> Net			  6,214		    5,486</p>
<p> Revs			18,375		   16,942</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,113		   16,036</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Quarters ended March 31.</p>
<p>Funds from operations on a fully-converted basis totaled $10.2 million, or $0.49 per share in Q1 1997, versus $9.1 million, or $0.46 per share in Q1 1996.</p>
